#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:1 a440f5c9e02d46028c864cd962f738f1
msgid "构建数据集（Make Dataset）"
msgstr "Make Dataset"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:3 03ebefcacef345838eb4ad4c045890fd
msgid "`构建数据集` 是候选训练结构的生产台。它把“扩胞、应变、扰动、缺陷、表面、掺杂、磁性设置” 这些操作拆成卡片，让你把一批可信初始结构扩展成候选池。"
msgstr ""
"`Make Dataset` is the workbench for producing candidate training "
"structures. It turns operations such as supercells, strain, perturbation,"
" defects, surfaces, doping, and magnetic settings into cards, so that a "
"set of trusted initial structures can be expanded into a candidate pool."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:24 da26bd7a61844346844926c73bf02041
msgid "它的输出通常还不是最终训练集。更稳的路线是："
msgstr "Its output is normally not a finished training set. A safer workflow is:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:26 d8ab8861a7b146a08b91d438e53700a4
msgid ""
"导入初始结构\n"
"-> 用卡片生成候选结构\n"
"-> 导出候选池\n"
"-> 在 NEP 数据集查看里清洗异常结构\n"
"-> 采样后送去 DFT\n"
msgstr ""
"Import starting structures\n"
"-> Generate candidates with cards\n"
"-> Export the candidate pool\n"
"-> Remove anomalous structures in NEP Dataset Display\n"
"-> Sample representative structures and send them to DFT\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:34 cba7d8f766054b838c7c6534535964a7
msgid "构建数据集工作区"
msgstr "Make Dataset workspace"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:34 cba7d8f766054b838c7c6534535964a7
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:39 6159010f2fd9471a9e055a2b5ebb35dd
msgid "基本操作顺序"
msgstr "Basic workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:41 df0b1ddebc7641e1a0b9659e4a2561b4
msgid "用顶部 `打开` 导入初始结构。"
msgstr "Use `Open` in the top toolbar to import the starting structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:42 39bf972525044a458f099720841758ed
msgid "点击 `添加新卡片` 添加生成或筛选卡片。"
msgstr "Click `Add new card` and choose a generation or filtering card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:43 07840fe3a54541ff80263a413dc2d1b5
msgid "展开卡片，只设置与当前物理目标直接相关的参数。"
msgstr ""
"Expand the card and set only the parameters required by the current "
"physical objective."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:44 52e98ec4f9a84e1a9df2226815c576be
msgid "勾选要运行的卡片。"
msgstr "Enable the cards that should run."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:45 5280442221a04be18bbbc1b982a99dfa
msgid "点击 `运行`。"
msgstr "Click `Run`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:46 4f86b1b6295d42bc8f8f1e74032067ba
msgid "在卡片上检查输出数量并导出结果。"
msgstr "Check the output count on each card, then export the result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:48 d2498318e2904191bef87cec9eea5837
msgid "不要跳过第一步。多数卡片需要已有结构作为输入；如果你想从晶体原型从零生成结构， 应该使用对应的生成型卡片，并单独检查输出是否符合材料体系。"
msgstr ""
"Do not skip the import step. Most cards require existing structures as "
"input. To generate from a crystal prototype without input structures, use"
" the appropriate generator card and independently verify that its outputs"
" belong to the intended material system."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:51 b39acf443a194f22b7e9a7737aacf6d2
msgid "卡片怎么串"
msgstr "Connect cards into a workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:53 9b97d825e41f499882eabcfe4ddcdc11
msgid "最常见的是线性链："
msgstr "The most common arrangement is a linear chain:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:55 761ef4b709c94395947181c8883c43f3
msgid "扩胞 → 晶格应变 → 原子扰动\n"
msgstr "Super Cell → Lattice Strain → Atomic Perturb\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:59 e0f2a1c292ed4cb792de06c0154beb98
msgid "每张卡会处理上一张卡的输出。一般原则是："
msgstr "Each card processes the output of the preceding card. As a rule:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:61 9f20dc38ac054d7c8b63cd84bacd4494
msgid "先改晶胞，再改原子坐标。"
msgstr "Modify the cell before modifying atomic coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:62 3f307ba4c3974ca0be2df425bf21d4c8
msgid "先做确定性结构变换，再做随机扰动。"
msgstr "Apply deterministic transformations before random perturbations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:63 81c4576be62d45e0933473fb9aea8514
msgid "先生成候选池，再做清洗和采样。"
msgstr "Generate the candidate pool before cleaning and sampling it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:65 62c275202ef743c3b8b8c3f39d551e73
msgid "如果同一个输入结构要走多条分支，例如一支做表面、一支做空位，可以用 `分支合并`（分支合并）。 组内卡片共享同一输入，输出再汇总。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Branch Merge` when the same input structure should follow several "
"branches, such as one branch for surfaces and another for vacancies. "
"Cards in the group receive the same input, and their outputs are merged "
"afterward."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:68 88f25ade13bb466aa3e6b93b445a35b7
msgid "什么时候导出"
msgstr "When to export intermediate results"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:70 cb64bfebcc1143119601c6558f8eea0d
msgid "每张卡运行后都应该先看输出数量。数量符合预期，再导出为中间文件，例如："
msgstr ""
"Check the output count after every card runs. If it matches the intended "
"combinatorics, export an intermediate file such as:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:72 51264c251f3f48ffa4c05940ac965f56
msgid ""
"candidate_pool.xyz\n"
"candidate_pool_clean.xyz\n"
"candidate_pool_fps.xyz\n"
msgstr ""
"candidate_pool.xyz\n"
"candidate_pool_clean.xyz\n"
"candidate_pool_fps.xyz\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:78 40b56fc39c3c4b85ab5cc1070cefef80
msgid "这样后续发现问题时，可以追溯到底是生成阶段、清洗阶段还是采样阶段引入的。"
msgstr ""
"These stage-specific files make it possible to trace a later problem to "
"generation, cleaning, or sampling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:80 cb9ca40139a14435bdbd0250dd199dbb
msgid "使用工作流库和模板"
msgstr "Use the workflow library and templates"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:82 af6c4fbb944f4839bee94c76ca3b1294
msgid "左侧工作流库分为三类："
msgstr "The workflow library on the left has three sections:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:84 4a23afa926494e178d2d653518bf1b45
#
msgid "`已保存`：已经命名并保存的工作流。"
msgstr "`Saved`: named workflows that you have saved."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:85 fb9ac3ab580f4a1b9e7c5202ed3428ed
#
msgid "`内置`：随软件提供的起始配方，只读。"
msgstr "`Built-in`: read-only starter recipes shipped with the application."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:86 c37598fa6828496a826780ae49f94a7b
#
msgid "`我的模板`：你保存或导入的模板。"
msgstr "`User`: templates that you saved or imported."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:88 2d627e901b0b45f9ba1ca6be9dff97b5
#
msgid ""
"双击模板只会打开**未修改的预览**，不会立刻算作新建工作流，也不会触发离开前的未保存提示。首次修改参数、卡片或顺序后，状态才变为“基于该模板”的未保存工作流；需要保留时，点击"
" `另存为工作流` 另存自己的副本。模板始终不会被改写。"
msgstr "Double-clicking a template opens an **unmodified preview**. It is not treated as a new workflow and leaving it does not trigger an unsaved-changes prompt. The first change to a parameter, card, or card order turns it into an unsaved workflow based on that template. Click `Save as workflow` to keep your own copy; the template itself is never overwritten."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:90 70218fd7f80d4855b0ac6bab25344949
msgid "当前内置模板只保留“结构扰动”。它从扩胞开始，将晶格应变和晶格随机扰动放入分支合并，再接原子扰动，适合作为结构采样工作流的起点。鼠标停在模板上会显示输入要求。"
msgstr ""
"The only built-in template currently provided is `Structure "
"Perturbation`. It starts with supercell expansion, branches into lattice "
"strain and random lattice perturbation, merges those results, and then "
"applies atomic perturbation. It is intended as a starting point for "
"structure-sampling workflows. Hover over the template to see its input "
"requirements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:92 a543f981798b4120a26e4078e3f75946
msgid ""
"工作流和用户模板以独立 JSON 文件保存在用户配置目录的 `workflows/saved` 和 `workflows/templates` "
"下；它们不存入 `config.sqlite`。内置模板则打包在软件中，不写入用户目录。两类 JSON "
"都只保存卡片顺序、参数和启停状态，不保存输入结构、运行结果或运行状态。"
msgstr ""
"Workflows and user templates are stored as separate JSON files under "
"`workflows/saved` and `workflows/templates` in the user configuration "
"directory; they are not stored in `config.sqlite`. Built-in templates are"
" packaged with the application and are not written to the user directory."
" Both JSON forms contain only card order, parameters, and enabled state, "
"never input structures, run results, or run state."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:94 48ecfbec335e42159eeca1a84a3e7438
msgid "保存工作流不等于保存生成结构。结构结果仍需从卡片导出。"
msgstr ""
"Saving a workflow does not save generated structures. Export structure "
"results from their cards."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:96 25e484e535234c1f86b5435e281413e0
msgid "从文档 JSON 直接创建卡片"
msgstr "Create cards directly from documentation JSON"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:98 0afd2662172f4047b5a2fce5ddd0bc88
msgid ""
"如果文档里给出的是单张卡片 JSON、卡片数组，或者完整的 `card_config.json`，可以先复制代码块，再回到 `构建数据集` "
"页面执行 `Load → Paste Card JSON`。"
msgstr ""
"If the documentation provides one card JSON object, an array of cards, or"
" a complete `card_config.json`, copy the code block and then return to "
"`Make Dataset` and run `Load → Paste Card JSON`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:100 7206222950864883925fabc2e14f7ffe
msgid ""
"这个入口不会清空当前工作区，只会把剪贴板里的卡片追加到末尾。需要完整替换工作区时，仍然使用 `Load → Import Card Config`"
" 导入保存好的 JSON 文件。"
msgstr ""
"This action appends the clipboard cards and does not clear the current "
"workspace. To replace the entire workspace, use `Load → Import Card "
"Config` and select a saved JSON file."

